  "details": "Right now, clicking the Shop button on the Quick Menu opens the exclusive store page.\n\nI think it would be nice if it opens the world store of the current world.\n\nAlso, when a player opens the shop tab and clicks on \"World Stores\" and selects a world, it does not open the store but the world. It feels a bit counterintuitive.\n\nOn the world page, some worlds listed in \"World Stores\", have no \"Store\" tab, which feels confusing. It likely refers to worlds with in-world stores.",
